Adv[Game 1: indistinguishability from game 18] <= 2 * #O_Ver / |t_SHA256_out| + N * PPRF(time_1, qVer + qMAC, max(maxlength(game 3: mv), maxlength(game 3: m)), qKDF256, qKDF128) + Adv[Game 18: indistinguishability from game 18]
Adv[Game 19: indistinguishability from game 37, non_unique_1 || non_unique] <= Pr[Game 20: non_unique] + Pr[Game 20: non_unique_1] + Adv[Game 20: indistinguishability from game 37]
Pr[Game 20: non_unique] <= 0
Pr[Game 20: non_unique_1] <= 0
Adv[Game 20: indistinguishability from game 37] <= 2 * #O_Ver / |t_SHA256_out| + N * PPRF(time_2, qVer + qMAC, max(maxlength(game 22: mv_1), maxlength(game 22: m_1)), 0, 0) + Adv[Game 37: indistinguishability from game 37]
RESULT Proved indistinguishability between game 19 and game 1 up to probability N * PPRF(time_2, qVer + qMAC, max(maxlength(game 22: mv_1), maxlength(game 22: m_1)), 0, 0) + 4 * #O_Ver / |t_SHA256_out| + N * PPRF(time_1, qVer + qMAC, max(maxlength(game 3: mv), maxlength(game 3: m)), qKDF256, qKDF128)
RESULT time_1 = time + (N * qKDF128 - qKDF128) * time(KDF128) + (N * qKDF256 - qKDF256) * time(KDF256) + (N * qVer + N * qMAC - qVer - qMAC) * time(MAC, max(maxlength(game 3: mv), maxlength(game 3: m)))
RESULT time_2 = #O_Ver * qMAC * time(= bitstring, maxlength(game 22: mv_1), maxlength(game 22: m_1)) + time + (N * qVer + N * qMAC - qVer - qMAC) * time(MAC, max(maxlength(game 22: mv_1), maxlength(game 22: m_1)))
